<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage at 7.324 bln rand Tues.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage at 7.324 bln rand Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage fell to 7.324 billion rand on Tuesday from 7.610 billion rand on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>All South African markets were closed on Monday for the Youth Day holiday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
